  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Identification and classification of geological heritage objects in Kitab and Shakhrisabz regions and increasing public awareness of geological heritage</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to study all geological heritage objects (geological, paleontological, geomorphological, speleological) located in the Shakhrisabz and Kitab (Kitab Geological National Natural Park) regions, in order to register the natural heritage sites of Uzbekistan. The project would raise awareness of people through campaign, the publication and creation of an online map of geological objects for the website https://kitabgeopark.uz.</narrative>
  </description>
